"## Build authentication service\n\nImplement the JWT-based authentication service, including token issuance, refresh, and revocation endpoints.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n\n- [ ] POST /auth/token issues a signed JWT (HS256)\n- [ ] POST /auth/refresh extends expiry on valid token\n- [ ] POST /auth/revoke adds token to blocklist\n- [ ] All endpoints return RFC 7807 error bodies on failure\n\n### Notes\n\nUse the shared `pkg/jwt` library for signing. The secret is loaded from the `JWT_SECRET` env var via the secrets manager.\n"
